OL,3,GNEWSA'Life-saving' mums charity could
OL,4,Aclose waiting list
OL,5,
OL,6,FA "life-saving" charity that supports
OL,7,Fnew mothers may have to close its
OL,8,Fwaiting list if urgent funding cannot
OL,9,Fbe raised.
OL,11,FFrome Birth Talk provided counselling
OL,12,Fto more than 155 mothers in 2026, but
OL,13,Fcharity chiefs warn they will have to
OL,14,Fcut back on support unless they can
OL,15,Fraise #10,000 by Sunday.
OL,17,FSarah N'Guio received counselling from
OL,18,Fthe charity a year after giving birth
OL,19,Fand said it saved her life, adding:
OL,20,F"Without them, I probably would have
OL,21,Flost my children and lost my life."
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
